1
00:00:00,540 --> 00:00:03,851
Kehte hain — chhoti dukaan ko software ki kya zaroorat?

2
00:00:04,989 --> 00:00:08,115
Jisne chaalis saal, bahi mein paai-paai jodi...

3
00:00:09,253 --> 00:00:12,405
Jo khuli goli ka daam bhi imaandaari se gine...

4
00:00:13,538 --> 00:00:17,108
Jo shutter giraate hue bhi, ek maa ke liye ruk jaaye...

5
00:00:18,240 --> 00:00:22,009
Jo udhaar bhi de... aur rishta bhi nibhaaye...

6
00:00:23,348 --> 00:00:27,630
Uske liye software... mehenga tha, ya uljha.

7
00:00:28,889 --> 00:00:32,771
Humare jaisi dukaan ke liye... koi banata bhi hai?

8
00:00:34,246 --> 00:00:38,014
Nexcod POS — ek pharmacy counter se shuru hua.

9
00:00:38,347 --> 00:00:41,094
Isliye ye counter ki zubaan bolta hai.

10
00:00:43,779 --> 00:00:47,615
Expiry, stock, udhaar — roz ka jhanjhat, ek jagah.

11
00:00:48,871 --> 00:00:52,299
Arre! Ye toh apne bas ka nikla.

12
00:00:53,728 --> 00:00:58,027
Bharat mein bana. Aaj 24 rajyon aur UT mein.

13
00:00:59,462 --> 00:01:03,646
₹1,299 saal ka — lagbhag ₹108 mahina.

14
00:01:03,988 --> 00:01:08,473
7 din free trial. Card nahi, auto-renew nahi.

15
00:01:09,706 --> 00:01:11,367
Daave hum nahi karenge.

16
00:01:11,690 --> 00:01:13,260
Chala kar khud dekhiye.

17
00:01:15,338 --> 00:01:18,470
Nexcod POS — aapke counter ke naap ka.
